        "text": "<thinking> To extract text from a scanned document image, I will use the Amazon Textract service, which is a powerful OCR (Optical Character Recognition) service provided by AWS. I will write the Python code to call the Amazon Textract API and extract the text from the image. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and the use of the `textract` client. </thinking>\n",
